Comments

```
Visible.

%% this line is a comment

%%%
a hidden
block
%%%

Also visible.
.
<p>Visible.</p>
<p>Also visible.</p>
```

```
Also visible. %% this tail is a comment
.
<p>Also visible.</p>
```

```
50%% off and a%%b stay literal.
.
<p>50%% off and a%%b stay literal.</p>
```

```
Run `a %% b` then done. %% gone
.
<p>Run <code>a %% b</code> then done.</p>
```

```
# Title %% editor note
.
<section id="Title">
  <h1>Title</h1>
</section>
```

```
foo %% note
bar
.
<p>foo
bar</p>
```

```
x
  %% indented comment
y
.
<p>x</p>
<p>y</p>
```

```
before

  %% indented comment

after
.
<p>before</p>
<p>after</p>
```
